# Vercel Deployment Configuration
# By default, Vercel uses frontend/vercel.json to rewrite /api/v1/* and /uploads/* 
# directly to your Render backend: https://flipkart-backend-kf09.onrender.com
# This ensures first-party cookies, eliminates CORS preflights, and simplifies deployment.

# OPTIONAL: Only set this variable if you want the frontend to make direct cross-origin API calls:
# REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://flipkart-backend-kf09.onrender.com
